# Attentive Sunscribe {1}{W}: "Whenever this creature becomes tapped, scry 1." (CR 701.22) Tapping Bot1's Mox Pearl on turn 3 is another permanent
# becoming tapped and scries nothing (no question is asked). Attacking taps the Sunscribe, so Bot1 scries the Mountain on top of its library
# (the Island was drawn on turn 3) and puts it on the bottom: the card drawn on turn 5 is the Forest below it, and the Mountain never reaches the hand.

